### Listar
GET http://localhost:8080/funcionarios
Accept: application/json

### Cadastrar
POST http://localhost:8080/funcionarios
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{"nome": "Bruno Souza", "cargo": "Desenvolvedor", "salario": 3500.0}

### Buscar por ID
GET http://localhost:8080/funcionarios/1

### Filtrar
GET http://localhost:8080/funcionarios?cargo=desenvolvedor

### Atualizar (todos os campos)
PUT http://localhost:8080/funcionarios/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"nome": "Bruno Souza Atualizado", "cargo": "Desenvolvedor", "salario": 3500.0}

### Excluir
DELETE http://localhost:8080/funcionarios/1

### Inválido: 400
POST http://localhost:8080/funcionarios
Content-Type: application/json

{}
